        <mxCell id="n16" value="Only a session with the MANAGER role gets&#10;past the login screen (FR11, N5).&#10;&#10;Every Api method is async and returns a&#10;Future. Screens await it and show a loading&#10;state, so the window never freezes (N2)." style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="760" width="270" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n17" value="&lt;&lt;bookstore-ui&gt;&gt;: shared with the customer&#10;app, in clients/bookstore-ui.&#10;BooksView also searches with BookApi.&#10;OrdersView opens a private _OrderDialog:&#10;the bill (BillView), mark as paid, print.&#10;&#10;Blue: screens. Green: calls to the services.&#10;Yellow: data. Grey: application, session,&#10;rules." style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1440" y="760" width="270" height="200" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
